OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office back five months after
OL,4,Ahigh street loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA high street has regained a post
OL,7,Foffice five months after a shop it was
OL,8,Foperating from closed.
OL,10,FThe new post office for Ipswich will
OL,11,Freopen next month in the Sailmakers
OL,12,FShopping Centre, on Tavern Street.
OL,14,FThe service will open in a fully
OL,15,Frefurbished unit and sell a range of
OL,16,Fitems including cards and stationery.
OL,17,FIt will also offer banking services.
OL,19,FAn experienced postmaster, with a
OL,20,Fbranch in Northampton, has been
OL,21,Fappointed to operate the Ipswich postal
OL,22,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
